    <string name="formats22_animation_message">%1$s eneefreyimu %2$s. I-AN Paint ihlela imifanekiso engashukumiyo kwaye ayigcini ukushukuma kwemifanekiso.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_poster">I-PNG enomfanekiso omiselweyo owahlukileyo. Kuya kungeniswa loo mfanekiso endaweni yeefreyimu zomfanekiso oshukumayo. Ukuwugcina kudala umfanekiso ongashukumiyo.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_still">Kuya kungeniswa ifreyimu yokuqala kuphela. Ukugcina kudala umfanekiso ongashukumiyo.</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_title">Umfanekiso oshukumayo</string>
    <string name="formats22_animation_unknown">%1$s enesakhiwo esintsonkothe kakhulu ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuba ineefreyimu ezininzi na. I-AN Paint iya kuvula umfanekiso ongashukumiyo kuphela kwaye ayiyi kugcina nakuphi na ukushukuma.</string>
    <string name="formats22_ascii_description">Ibhala umbhalo ongenalufomatho ngoonobumba abakhanyayo nabamnyama. Wujonge ngefonti apho bonke oonobumba benobubanzi obulinganayo. Oku kukuboniswa komfanekiso kuphela; akunakuphinda kuvulwe njengomfanekiso wokuqala.</string>
    <string name="formats22_import_limit">Le fayile igqitha kumda wokungenisa oyi-512 MiB. Khetha ifayile encinane.</string>
    <string name="formats22_open_still">Vula umfanekiso ongashukumiyo</string>
    <string name="formats22_pdf_raster_hint">Amaphepha e-PDF aguqulwa abe yimifanekiso kwi-144 dpi. Umbhalo nezinto ze-vector ziba ziipikseli.</string>
    <string name="gallery_credit_could_not_save">Iinkcukacha zomdali womfanekiso, umthombo nelayisenisi azikwazanga ukugcinwa okanye ukubuyiselwa. Iinkcukacha ebezigciniwe ngaphambili zisekhona. Zama kwakhona.</string>
    <string name="gallery_credit_too_large">Ezi nkcukacha zomdali womfanekiso, umthombo nelayisenisi zingabangela ukuba umzobo ugqithe kubungakanani obunokubuyiselwa. Umzobo wakho wangaphambili neenkcukacha zawo zigciniwe.</string>
